<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Locate the guide rod</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"></head>
<body><article class="card ">
<header><span class="eyebrow"><b>Installation</b> &middot; build guide</span><h1>Locate the guide rod</h1><i class="rule"></i><p class="lede">Each {{rod}} mm rod stands {{integration_rod_axis_from_inside_wall_mm_g}} mm inward from the vessel's wet inside wall. Use the vessel datum, not the end-cap edge.</p></header>
<main><figure class="short"><img src="art/guide-fit.png" alt="An explanatory {{rod}} mm rod through the actual {{bore}} mm float bore. This picture shows the guide interface, not measured liquid performance."><figcaption>An explanatory {{rod}} mm rod through the actual {{bore}} mm float bore. This picture shows the guide interface, not measured liquid performance.</figcaption></figure><table class="compact"><tr><td class="k">Rod / radial running play</td><td>{{rod}} / {{dims_guide_radial_clearance_g}} mm</td></tr><tr><td class="k">Body-to-wall clearance</td><td>2 mm nominal &middot; {{integration_carbonator_upright_wall_clearance_range_mm_0_g}}-{{integration_carbonator_upright_wall_clearance_range_mm_1_g}} mm upright range</td></tr><tr><td class="k">Carbonator finished rod</td><td>{{carb_rod}} &middot; FR-CARB-01 finished length and end form</td></tr><tr><td class="k">Reservoir rod cut</td><td>{{res_rod}} &middot; {{res_rod_clearance}} mm axial clearance</td></tr><tr><td class="k">Greatest float-edge to reed distance</td><td>{{integration_maximum_float_edge_to_reed_center_mm_carbonator_p3f}} mm carbonator / {{integration_maximum_float_edge_to_reed_center_mm_reservoir_p3f}} mm reservoir</td></tr></table><p>Use the <a href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/derekbreden/homesodamachine/main/hardware/printed-parts/cold-core/magnetic-float/all-aero/installation.md">installation record</a> for the carbonator blind-drill coordinates and the matching reservoir body/cap bosses. Confirm free motion over the actual travel.</p><div class="mind"><span class="mind-label">Carbonator capture</span><p>The 36 mm float is captured on the rod before final vessel closure. It cannot pass through the NPT ports. Welding exposure and post-closure function have no acceptance record.</p></div></main><footer><span>ASA Aero magnetic float &middot; Home Soda Machine</span><span class="folio">10</span></footer>
</article></body></html>